They place it, then choose the next piece for you. Every gift shapes the board.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,526
Four pieces in a line share one attribute — that is a quarto.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,602
Four computer levels, from a gentle companion to forced-piece search.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,102
Two players on one screen, or a phone joins on the same Wi-Fi.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,950
Hints that explain why, undo, autosave, a family record. Offline, no account, no ads.

